    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSTUNNING A RATED FOUR BED CITY HOME\n\nSavills is delighted to present No. 69 Aylesbury, a superb four-bedroom semi-detached residence in this exclusive and highly sought-after development in Ballintemple, Cork. \n\nImmaculately presented throughout, this exceptional home has benefitted from a range of carefully considered upgrades by the current owners, resulting in a stylish, high-quality family home finished well above the original specification.\n\nA welcoming entrance hall introduces the accommodation, with high-quality engineered wood flooring running throughout the ground floor, creating a seamless flow between the living spaces. To the front, the elegant living room features a bespoke fitted wall unit incorporating a concealed home workstation with luxurious quartz worktops, providing an ideal work-from-home solution. Bespoke wooden café-style shutters add both character and practicality.\n\nTo the rear, the impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home. Designed for modern family living and entertaining, the upgraded kitchen boasts a larger-than-standard island with porcelain countertops, ample storage and quality finishes throughout. Additional electrical points and upgraded spotlighting enhance functionality, while large glazed doors fill the space with natural light and provide direct access to the rear garden. A guest WC, separate utility room and excellent storage complete the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, there are four generously proportioned bedrooms, all designed with comfort and practicality in mind. The principal bedroom benefits from a stylish en-suite bathroom, while fitted wardrobes provide excellent storage. A beautifully finished family bathroom with contemporary sanitary ware and quality tiling serves the remaining bedrooms.\n\nOutside, the west facing rear garden offers a private space for relaxing and entertaining, enhanced by garden lighting that creates a wonderful evening ambience. \n\nWith an excellent A2 BER rating and energy-efficient air-to-water heat pump system, this home delivers outstanding comfort and efficiency. The current owners have significantly upgraded the property beyond the standard specification, incorporating bespoke joinery, a feature living room wall with concealed workstation and quartz worktop, an enlarged kitchen island with premium porcelain countertops, additional electrical points, upgraded lighting, and bespoke wooden café-style shutters throughout.\n\nNo. 69 Aylesbury is a superb turnkey family home, combining bespoke upgrades, premium finishes and exceptional attention to detail in one of Cork's most sought-after residential locations."
      },
      {
